# Docs in docs/

## README sections (required for section folders)

Navigation · Purpose · Related Documents · Future Topics

## Style

- Meaningful content only; no "Coming soon" or lorem ipsum
- Company website is the product surface; `docs/` supports building/running it — not a docs product
- One section per change when possible; link out instead of duplicating repo overview

## Decisions

Significant technical/org choices → `docs/decisions/NNNN-kebab-title.md` from `templates/adr-template.md`

## Legacy paths

`docs/adr/` and `docs/governance/` are redirects → use `docs/decisions/`, `docs/company/`
